"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D3_HINT_CIN:-1499-01-01:0":{"b": ["Dholavira: Dholavira Stage VII ends", "87ad0540"], "d": ["A Harappan city on Khadir island in Kachchh; according to the UNESCO/ASI scheme, an occupation of about 1,500 years in 7 stages beginning c. 3000 BCE; Stage VII (~1500-1450 BCE) was a final settlement without urban character, and the site was never inhabited afterwards.", "a6493b11"]},
