"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D3_MISIR_AFRIKA:-1079-01-01:0":{"b": ["Conquest of Nubia by New Kingdom Egypt / Egyptian occupation (post-Kerma): the Egyptian occupation of Nubia ends", "8241bd37"], "d": ["The Kerma kingdom was conquered by the New Kingdom pharaohs; kerma.ch attributes the conquest to Thutmose I (1496-1483) and notes that Egyptian influence was felt south of the Third Cataract only under Thutmose III (1479-1424).", "b10ad95e"]},
